   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Cape Cod Summer Guide 2025: Visiting Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><b>Planning your Cape Cod getaway this summer?</b> Whether you’re beach hopping in Wellfleet, biking the Rail Trail, or simply soaking up the sun, don’t forget to make a stop at <i>Cape Cod Cannabis</i>—your friendly, recreational dispensary just off Route 6 in the South Wellfleet shopping plaza. <em><strong>We offer the largest selection of quality cannabis products at the best prices on Cape Cod. It’s worth the trip!</strong></em></p><p><em> </em></p><p><img src=\"assets/source/3b5c31dc-CCC-Its-worth-the-trip-300x300.png\" alt=\"Your Cape Cod Summer Guide 2025: Cape Cod Cannabis Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/CCC-Its-worth-the-trip-300x300.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/64120d9f-CCC-Its-worth-the-trip.png\"></p><p>Here’s everything you need to know about visiting Cape Cod Cannabis during your summer vacation: <strong>Cape Cod Summer Guide 2025</strong> </p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Why Visit Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Nestled between the beauty of the ocean and pine-covered vibes, our <b>Wellfleet dispensary</b> offers a laid-back yet professional environment where you can <a href=\"/menu/\">explore a wide range of recreational cannabis products</a>. We offer the largest selection of quality cannabis products, at the best prices on Cape Cod…It’s worth the trip! —and we cater to everyone, from first-timers to seasoned connoisseurs.</p><p>What sets Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary apart?</p><ul><li><strong>The largest selection of quality cannabis products</strong> at the best prices on Cape Cod…<em>It’s worth the trip!</em></li></ul><ul><li><p><b>Locally curated cannabis</b> from trusted Massachusetts growers</p></li><li><p><b>Friendly, knowledgeable budtenders</b> who make recommendations based on your desired effects</p></li><li><p><b>Clean, modern retail space</b> just minutes from Wellfleet beaches and bike trails</p></li><li><p><b><a href=\"/menu/\">Online ordering</a> and easy parking</b> for your convenience</p></li><li><a href=\"/beautiful-wellfleet-ma-attractions/\" data-link=\"dead\">Click here</a> for local Wellfleet restaurants, shopping, galleries, charters and attractions</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "A Cape Cod Adventure Day Essential"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><em>What’s a perfect Cape Cod adventure without a little enhancement?</em> From <b><a href=\"/categories/flower/\">flower</a> and <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a></b> to <b><a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vapes</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a>, <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/\">tinctures</a>, <a href=\"/strains/high-cbd/\">CBD</a>, <a href=\"/categories/topicals/\">topicals</a>, <a href=\"/categories/accessories/\">accessories</a> </b>and <a href=\"/categories/merch/\"><b>apparel</b></a> our menu is curated to elevate your adventure, bonfire, or sunset session. Popular nearby beaches like <b>Cahoon Hollow</b>, <b>Marconi</b>, and <b>Duck Harbor</b> are all just a short drive away.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Cannabis Etiquette for Cape Visitors"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>We love cannabis—but also want everyone to enjoy it safely and legally:</p><ul><li><p><b>Consume only on private property</b>: Public consumption is not allowed in Massachusetts.</p></li><li><p><b>Keep it sealed in your car</b>: Just like alcohol, open containers are a no-go. <strong>Please be mindful of leaving batteries and vapes in a hot car. <a href=\"/warning-cartridge-disposable-vape-consumers/\">Click here for best practices.</a></strong></p></li><li><p><b>Be mindful of your surroundings</b>: Respect local families, beachgoers, and your rental host’s policies.</p></li></ul><p>When in doubt, ask us! We’re happy to help you stay compliant while enjoying your visit. <em>*Please follow MA laws regarding cannabis in public and always consume responsibly.</em></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "What’s Hot This Summer?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>For Summer 2025, we’re seeing a rise in demand for:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"/categories/flower/infused-bud-2/\"><b>Infused pre-rolls</b></a> for longer-lasting effects on long summer days</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/categories/edibles/drinks/\"><b>THC beverages &amp; seltzers</b></a> – chill, social, and refreshing</p></li><li><p><b>Uplifting <a href=\"/strains/sativa/\">sativas</a> </b>&amp; <b><a href=\"/strains/hybrid/\">hybrids</a></b> perfect for active days</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/strains/high-cbd/\"><b>CBD-rich products</b></a> for recovery and relaxation after outdoor adventures</p></li></ul><p>Ask our knowledgeable staff for recommendations tailored to your plans—hiking, kayaking, or just porch-sitting with friends.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "First Time Visiting a Dispensary in MA?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>No worries—we welcome all adults 21+ with a valid ID. Whether you’re a cannabis connoisseur or a curious first-timer, our<em> <b>friendly and educated team</b></em> is here to guide you. You’ll find clear <a href=\"/menu/\">menus</a>, locally sourced products, and a relaxing, judgment-free space.</p><p><i>Pro Tip:</i> Check out our <a href=\"/faqs-420/\">FAQ page</a> before visiting for tips on what to bring and how to shop.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Where to Find Us"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><b>Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary<br></b>1446 State Highway Route 6<br>Wellfleet, MA 02667<br>(774) 383-3133</p><ul><li>Offering the largest selection of quality cannabis products at the best prices on Cape Cod. <em>It’s worth the trip!</em></li><li>The coolest vibe and the best, friendly and knowledgeable budtenders on Cape Cod.</li><li>Open 7 days a week!</li><li>Plenty of parking | Online ordering available | 21+ only with valid ID | <a href=\"/directions/\">Click here for directions</a></li><li>Order ahead on our <a href=\"/menu/\">menu page</a> and pick up your stash with ease—no need to cut into your beach time.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Summer Bargains + Merch"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>This summer, don’t miss out on our limited-edition <a href=\"/categories/merch/\"><b>Cape Cod Cannabis apparel</b></a>, exclusive <a href=\"/categories/accessories/\"><b>420-friendly accessories</b></a>, and weekly <a href=\"/specials/\"><strong>Blazing Bargains &amp; Bundles</strong></a> for locals, visitors and vacationers.</p><p><em><strong>Sign up for our FREE Loyalty VIP Program</strong></em> to stay updated on rotating <b>summer promos and events</b> and accumulate redeemable points. <a href=\"/shop-your-loyalty-points/\">Click here for more information or to join today</a>!</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Cape Cod Summer Guide 2025: Make It a Summer to Remember"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><em>Cape Cod is all about making memories—why not elevate them? </em>Summer on Cape Cod is all about beach days, seafood feasts, and unforgettable memories—and for many visitors and local residents, that includes discovering high-quality cannabis experiences. Whether you’re here for a weekend or a full vacation, <b>Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet</b> is the #1 cannabis dispensary choice and your go-to destination for premium products, friendly service, and local knowledge.</p><p><strong><em>Stop in, stock up, and savor the summer in Cape Cod style! Have a safe, fun and great Cape Cod Summer 2025! See you soon.</em></strong></p><p><img src=\"assets/source/80866f34-CCC_Logo_250px.png\" alt=\"Visit Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA! It's worth the trip!\" width=\"250\" height=\"200\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/CCC_Logo_250px.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\"></p>"
    }
   ]
  },
